WEBVTT

00:08.896 --> 00:10.068
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.172 --> 00:11.896
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.000 --> 00:13.344
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.448 --> 00:15.068
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.172 --> 00:18.310
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:18.413 --> 00:20.344
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.448 --> 00:22.379
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:22.482 --> 00:24.689
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:24.793 --> 00:26.310
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:26.413 --> 00:28.344
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:28.448 --> 00:29.931
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:30.344 --> 00:32.344
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:32.448 --> 00:34.379
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:34.482 --> 00:36.310
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.413 --> 00:39.241
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.344 --> 00:40.206
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.310 --> 00:42.758
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:45.137 --> 00:48.655
Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
字幕由 THE 赞助
美国教育部

00:48.758 --> 00:50.689
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

01:07.137 --> 01:09.172
Wait for it...
等等吧...

01:25.931 --> 01:27.689
Another day, another migraine.
另一天，又是偏头痛。

01:29.137 --> 01:30.275
Mi...
米...

01:34.000 --> 01:35.551
graine.
颗粒。

01:38.103 --> 01:39.620
Isn't it great
不是很好吗

01:39.724 --> 01:42.172
working at
the Krusty Krab,
Squidward?
工作于
蟹堡王，
章鱼哥？

01:42.275 --> 01:43.172
Huh? Isn't it?
啊？不是吗？

01:43.275 --> 01:44.275
Working here?
在这里工作？

01:44.379 --> 01:45.379
Yeah, great.
是的，太棒了。

01:45.413 --> 01:46.586
Yeah.Yeah.
是啊是啊。

01:46.689 --> 01:47.689
Oh, yeah. Yes!
哦，是的。是的！

01:47.793 --> 01:49.137
Hold that thought, Squidward.
保持这个想法，章鱼哥。

01:49.241 --> 01:52.482
I'm due in the parking lot
for early morning litter patrol.
我该到停车场了
清晨进行垃圾巡逻。

01:52.586 --> 01:54.379
May Neptune shine brightly
on my harvest.
愿海王星闪耀
论我的收获。

01:58.137 --> 01:59.620
Litter.
垃圾。

01:59.724 --> 02:02.103
Looks like someone
missed the trash basket,
看起来像某人
错过了垃圾桶，

02:02.206 --> 02:03.241
huh, Mr. Candy Wrapper?
嗯，糖果包装先生？

02:03.344 --> 02:05.068
Kids these days.
这年头的孩子们。

02:07.034 --> 02:08.862
I've never seen
such an epidemic!
我从未见过
如此流行病！

02:08.965 --> 02:10.931
Well, at least
it's all over now.
嗯，至少
现在一切都结束了。

02:12.413 --> 02:14.000
Huh?
啊？

02:14.103 --> 02:15.448
Huh?!
啊？！

02:15.551 --> 02:16.551
Huh?
啊？

02:24.034 --> 02:26.724
Where is all this litter
coming from?
这些垃圾在哪里
来自？

02:31.448 --> 02:33.689
Not on my watch.
不在我的监视之下。

02:33.793 --> 02:35.241
Sir, I will have you know
先生，我会让你知道

02:35.344 --> 02:36.862
it's against the law to litter.
乱扔垃圾是违法的。

02:36.965 --> 02:38.965
Ha! What are you
going to do,
哈!你会怎样做，

02:39.068 --> 02:40.068
call the police?
打电话叫警察？

02:41.172 --> 02:42.206
Yes.
是的。

02:48.586 --> 02:50.724
How's it going, lieutenant?
怎么样，中尉？

02:50.827 --> 02:53.551
Well, let's just say
I hope our litterbug there
好吧，我们就说一下
我希望我们的垃圾虫在那里

02:53.655 --> 02:55.448
saved room
for his just desserts.
保存的房间
为了他的甜点。

02:56.965 --> 02:57.965
Yeah!
是的！

02:58.068 --> 03:00.172
Just desserts.
只是甜点。

03:00.275 --> 03:01.896
Whatever.
任何。

03:02.000 --> 03:04.000
SpongeBob,
don't you know
who that is?
海绵宝宝，
你不知道吗
那是谁？

03:04.103 --> 03:04.862
Who?
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？

03:04.965 --> 03:07.586
That's the Tattletale Strangler!
这就是流言蜚语扼杀者！

03:07.689 --> 03:08.517
Who?
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？

03:08.620 --> 03:10.000
The Tattletale Strangler!
流言蜚语扼杀者！

03:10.103 --> 03:12.137
He's promised to strangle anyone
他发誓要勒死任何人

03:12.241 --> 03:13.827
who turns him in!
谁把他举报了！

03:17.034 --> 03:19.310
He seems kind of angry with us,
eh, Squidward?
他似乎对我们有点生气
呃，章鱼哥？

03:20.379 --> 03:21.275
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

03:21.379 --> 03:22.517
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

03:22.620 --> 03:25.103
You're going
to do time,
Strangler.
你要去
做时间，
绞杀者。

03:25.206 --> 03:26.275
Hard time.
艰难的时光。

03:26.379 --> 03:27.620
Hi, officers.
嗨，军官们。

03:27.724 --> 03:29.586
So he's going to jail, right?
所以他要进监狱了，对吗？

03:29.689 --> 03:30.758
Who, Strangler?
谁，扼杀者？

03:30.862 --> 03:32.310
Yeah, Strangler.
是的，绞杀者。

03:32.413 --> 03:33.482
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

03:33.586 --> 03:35.517
He's going to jail
for a long time.
他要进监狱了
很长一段时间。

03:35.620 --> 03:37.310
Hey, that looks like me!
嘿，这看起来像我！

03:44.448 --> 03:45.965
Don't worry, SpongeBob,
别担心，海绵宝宝，

03:46.068 --> 03:47.862
he won't be able
to strangle you.
他不能
勒死你。

03:47.965 --> 03:50.172
Yeah, we got him
chained up
real good.
是的，我们抓住了他
拴起来
真的很好。

03:50.275 --> 03:51.482
He'll never get away.
他永远不会逃脱。

03:51.586 --> 03:52.862
Oops, not again.
哎呀，又不行了。

03:52.965 --> 03:54.482
Yup, he got away.
是的，他逃走了。

03:57.034 --> 04:00.724
You nice officers
will protect me, right?
你们这些好军官
会保护我的，对吗？

04:00.827 --> 04:02.862
We ain't bodyguards, kid.
我们不是保镖，孩子。

04:02.965 --> 04:04.413
Yeah, give us a call
是的，给我们打电话

04:04.517 --> 04:06.793
if you see him
again, tattletale.
如果你看到他
又是，流言蜚语。

04:10.206 --> 04:13.103
Those officers are right...
I need a bodyguard.
那些官员说得对……
我需要一名保镖。

04:13.206 --> 04:15.310
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

04:15.413 --> 04:17.379
There's a maniac after me.
有一个疯子在追我。

04:17.482 --> 04:19.068
I need a bodyguard!
我需要一个保镖！

04:21.344 --> 04:24.551
I wasn't five-time
golden claws in the navy
我没有五次
海军中的金色爪子

04:24.655 --> 04:25.655
for nothing.
无缘无故。

04:25.724 --> 04:27.000
When he see me moves,
当他看到我的动作时

04:27.103 --> 04:28.965
he'll be running scared.
他会害怕地逃跑。

04:29.068 --> 04:31.103
So where is this little bully,
那么这个小恶霸在哪里呢？

04:31.206 --> 04:32.448
down at the park?
在公园下面？

04:32.551 --> 04:33.931
The soda shop?
汽水店？

04:34.034 --> 04:35.862
What does he look like, eh, boy?
他看起来像什么，呃，男孩？

04:35.965 --> 04:37.344
This would be him,
Mr. Krabs.
这将是他，
蟹老板。

04:38.620 --> 04:40.862
The Tattletale Strangler!
流言蜚语扼杀者！

04:40.965 --> 04:42.413
Go away, SpongeBob.
走开，海绵宝宝。

04:42.517 --> 04:44.862
Take your death cloud with you!
带上你的死亡云吧！

04:56.275 --> 04:57.827
Hold me!
Hold me!
抱紧我！
抱紧我！

04:59.655 --> 05:01.689
That's it,
I got to get out of town
就是这样，
我必须出城

05:01.793 --> 05:02.965
till I can find a bodyguard.
直到我能找到保镖。

05:03.068 --> 05:04.586
Bodyguard, huh?
保镖吧？

05:04.689 --> 05:06.517
Uh, I might be able
to help you out.
呃，我也许可以
来帮助你。

05:06.620 --> 05:08.034
You don't understand, mister.
你不明白，先生。

05:08.137 --> 05:11.206
I need protection from
the scariest guy in town.
我需要保护
镇上最可怕的人。

05:11.310 --> 05:12.413
Here's his picture.
这是他的照片。

05:13.931 --> 05:15.310
He doesn't look so tough.
他看上去并不那么坚强。

05:15.413 --> 05:16.862
I tattled on him,
我闲聊他，

05:16.965 --> 05:18.931
and now he wants to strangle me
现在他想勒死我

05:19.034 --> 05:20.724
with his diabolical hands!
用他那双邪恶的手！

05:20.827 --> 05:22.413
I hope they're not dirty.
我希望它们不脏。

05:27.206 --> 05:28.965
Huh?
啊？

05:29.068 --> 05:32.620
Uh-oh, there's too many
witnesses around here.
呃哦，太多了
周围的目击者。

05:32.724 --> 05:35.551
Listen, kid, I could
be your bodyguard.
听着，孩子，我可以
做你的保镖。

05:35.655 --> 05:36.965
Here's my card.
这是我的名片。

05:37.068 --> 05:37.758
Hmm...
唔...

05:37.862 --> 05:39.413
Looks good to me.
我觉得不错。

05:39.517 --> 05:40.689
You're hired!
你被录用了！

05:40.793 --> 05:42.724
I feel safer already.
What's next?
我已经感觉更安全了。
接下来怎么办？

05:42.827 --> 05:45.275
Well, the maniac
could be anywhere
嗯，疯子
可能在任何地方

05:45.379 --> 05:46.758
wearing a disguise.
穿着伪装。

05:46.862 --> 05:48.379
He could be that old man.
他可能就是那个老人。

05:48.482 --> 05:49.482
Or that baby.
或者那个婴儿。

05:49.586 --> 05:50.689
Or that pebble!
或者那块鹅卵石！

05:50.793 --> 05:51.689
Or that stick.
或者那根棍子。

05:51.793 --> 05:52.862
Or that receipt
或者那张收据

05:52.965 --> 05:55.275
for the Phony Baloney
Mustache Emporium.
为了虚伪的胡言乱语
小胡子商场。

05:55.379 --> 05:56.517
Huh? Uh,
that's mine.
啊？呃，
那是我的。

05:56.620 --> 05:59.517
Oh, bodyguard, my body is
in your guarding hands.
噢，保镖，我的身体是
在你守护的手中。

05:59.620 --> 06:01.103
What do we do first?
我们首先做什么？

06:01.206 --> 06:04.896
Uh... I suggest
we go to a nice quiet,
secluded location,
呃……我建议
我们去一个美好的安静的地方，
位置僻静，

06:05.000 --> 06:07.517
like behind
an old dumpster,
or a dark alley.
就像在后面
一个旧垃圾箱，
或黑暗的小巷。

06:07.620 --> 06:08.793
We could go to my house
我们可以去我家

06:08.896 --> 06:10.413
and turn off all the lights.
并关掉所有的灯。

06:10.517 --> 06:11.862
Perfect.
完美的。

06:11.965 --> 06:14.448
That way no one
could hear you
being strangled...
这样就没有人了
能听到你的声音
被勒死……

06:14.551 --> 06:16.034
I mean, uh, uh, protected.
我的意思是，呃，呃，受到保护。

06:18.310 --> 06:20.275
Perfect.
完美的。

06:20.379 --> 06:22.551
Yes, excellent.
是的，非常好。

06:33.172 --> 06:35.172
Ah, but first
I got to do a few errands.
啊，但是首先
我得做几件事。

06:35.275 --> 06:37.137
Uh, okay, but let's
make it quick.
呃，好吧，但是让我们
快点。

06:37.241 --> 06:39.172
"Quick" is my middle name.
“快”是我的中间名。

06:40.137 --> 06:42.103
Let's see, paper towels.
让我们看看，纸巾。

06:42.206 --> 06:45.172
This one says,
"Best paper towel around."
这位说，
“最好的纸巾。”

06:45.275 --> 06:47.655
This one says,
"Best paper towel in town."
这位说，
“镇上最好的纸巾。”

06:47.758 --> 06:48.758
Hmm.
唔。

06:48.793 --> 06:49.620
"In town."
“在城里。”

06:49.724 --> 06:50.724
"Around."
“大约。”

06:50.793 --> 06:52.620
"In town."
“在城里。”

06:52.724 --> 06:53.965
"Around."
“大约。”

06:54.068 --> 06:55.758
What do you think, bodyguard?
保镖你觉得怎么样？

06:55.862 --> 06:58.310
Whatever gets us
to your house quicker.
无论什么让我们
更快到你家。

06:58.413 --> 07:00.103
I'll take both!
我两个都要！

07:00.206 --> 07:02.275
Here you go,
Mr. SquarePants.
给你，
方裤先生。

07:02.379 --> 07:03.689
Hmm...
唔...

07:03.793 --> 07:05.000
Is there something wrong?
有什么问题吗？

07:05.103 --> 07:08.275
I'm not sure if
these are my pants.
我不确定是否
这是我的裤子。

07:13.241 --> 07:14.758
How about this one, bodyguard?
保镖，这个怎么样？

07:14.862 --> 07:15.862
Too overbearing?
太霸道了？

07:15.965 --> 07:18.655
Can we just go to your house?
我们可以去你家吗？

07:19.931 --> 07:21.931
Here we are, SquarePants Manor.
我们到了，方裤庄园。

07:22.034 --> 07:24.413
Bodyguard, let me just
take this opportunity
保镖，让我
借此机会

07:24.517 --> 07:28.137
to say you're the best bodyguard
a fellow could hope to have.
说你是最好的保镖
一个人可能希望拥有。

07:28.241 --> 07:30.413
All right, enough
of the sappy talk.
好吧，够了
多愁善感的谈话。

07:30.517 --> 07:33.103
Open the door
so I can strangle you...
打开门
这样我就可以掐死你了...

07:33.206 --> 07:34.344
I mean, uh, choke you...
我的意思是，呃，窒息你...

07:34.448 --> 07:36.896
I mean, uh, crush
your windpipe... I mean...
我的意思是，呃，迷恋
你的气管...我是说...

07:37.000 --> 07:37.793
"Protect me"?
“保护我”？

07:37.896 --> 07:38.896
Thanks.
谢谢。

07:38.931 --> 07:40.275
Don't mention it, Strangler...
别提了，绞杀者……

07:41.517 --> 07:42.241
I mean "bodyguard."
我的意思是“保镖”。

07:42.344 --> 07:43.827
Now, where did I put my key?
现在，我把钥匙放在哪里了？

07:48.586 --> 07:50.241
Well, I can't find them.
嗯，我找不到他们。

07:50.344 --> 07:51.758
Do you want to take a look?
你想看一下吗？

07:51.862 --> 07:53.896
Forget the key!
忘记带钥匙了！

07:54.000 --> 07:55.551
Let's climb through this window.
让我们爬进这扇窗户吧。

07:56.689 --> 07:58.137
I can't reach it.
我够不着。

07:58.241 --> 08:00.344
Can you hop up
on my shoulders, kid?
你能跳起来吗
在我的肩膀上吗，孩子？

08:00.448 --> 08:01.551
Sure.
当然。

08:01.655 --> 08:04.344
With these spiky cleats,
anything is possible.
有了这些尖刺的防滑鞋，
一切皆有可能。

08:05.517 --> 08:06.620
"Cleats"?
“夹板”？

08:08.379 --> 08:10.310
Get your feet
out of my eye sockets!
站起来
从我的眼窝里出来！

08:10.413 --> 08:13.965
I'm trying, but my cleats
are stuck in your corneas!
我正在努力，但我的鞋
卡在你的角膜里了！

08:19.034 --> 08:21.344
Get off! Get off!
下车！下车！

08:25.965 --> 08:28.448
Oh, oh, oh!
哦，哦，哦！

08:30.655 --> 08:32.379
Don't be mad, bodyguard.
别生气，保镖。

08:32.482 --> 08:34.931
Let me just grab the key
I keep under the mat
让我抓住钥匙
我放在垫子下面

08:35.034 --> 08:37.000
and we can get inside.
我们可以进去了。

08:40.034 --> 08:41.793
There you are,
you little rascal.
你在那里，
你这个小流氓。

08:41.896 --> 08:43.206
Now to put it in the lock,
现在把它放进锁里，

08:43.310 --> 08:45.482
which should activate
the tumblers,
哪个应该激活
玻璃杯，

08:45.586 --> 08:46.896
thus opening the door.
从而打开门。

08:47.000 --> 08:49.379
Step inside...
走进去...

08:49.482 --> 08:52.137
Close the door...
关门...

08:52.931 --> 08:54.310
Well, here we are.
好吧，我们到了。

08:54.413 --> 08:58.137
I finally got you all alone!
我终于独自一人了！

09:01.344 --> 09:03.517
I know, isn't it great?
我知道，这不是很好吗？

09:10.103 --> 09:11.344
Ooh!
哦！

09:12.448 --> 09:16.034
Now you're going to
get yours, tattletale!
现在你要
得到你的，流言蜚语！

09:16.137 --> 09:18.413
Surprise!
Surprise!
Surprise!
Surprise!
惊喜！
惊喜！
惊喜！
惊喜！

09:20.241 --> 09:23.482
A surprise party to celebrate
惊喜派对庆祝

09:23.586 --> 09:26.551
my perfect on-time
percentage at work?
我的完美准时
工作百分比？

09:26.655 --> 09:28.000
Oh, how'd you guys know?
哦，你们怎么知道的？

09:28.103 --> 09:30.379
It's on the invitations
you sent us.
邀请函上有
你派我们来的。

09:30.482 --> 09:31.896
Let's boogie!
让我们布吉吧！

09:40.862 --> 09:43.379
Bye, everybody,
thanks for coming!
再见，大家，
感谢您的光临！

09:43.482 --> 09:46.344
Bye, Mr. Krabs, bye, Plankton,
bye, Sandy, bye, Larry,
再见，蟹老板，再见，浮游生物，
再见，桑迪，再见，拉里，

09:46.448 --> 09:49.482
bye, Pearl, bye, Mrs. Puff, bye,
Squidward, bye, the rest.
再见，珀尔，再见，普芙夫人，再见，
章鱼哥，再见，剩下的。

09:54.517 --> 09:56.034
Alone at last.
终于孤身一人了

09:56.137 --> 09:58.724
Huh? What? What?
啊？什么？什么？

09:58.827 --> 10:01.689
So we're all alone now?
所以我们现在都是孤独一人了？

10:01.793 --> 10:03.862
Just you, me
and the floorboards.
只有你、我
和地板。

10:07.172 --> 10:09.689
Yeah!
是的！

10:13.793 --> 10:17.000
Happy birthday, SpongeBob!
生日快乐，海绵宝宝！

10:17.103 --> 10:19.275
How did you guys know
today is my birthday?
你们怎么知道的
今天是我的生日吗？

10:19.379 --> 10:22.241
We just do what
the invitations say.
我们只是做些什么
邀请函上说。

10:22.344 --> 10:24.517
Let's boogie some more!
让我们再来点布吉吧！

10:35.103 --> 10:37.310
Thanks for coming!
感谢您的光临！

10:37.413 --> 10:38.413
Whew!
哇！

10:39.482 --> 10:40.379
Alone again.
又孤身一人了。

10:40.482 --> 10:41.206
Is it true?
这是真的吗？

10:41.310 --> 10:42.724
Everybody's gone?
大家都走了吗？

10:42.827 --> 10:43.724
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

10:43.827 --> 10:45.241
No more parties today?
今天不再聚会了吗？

10:45.344 --> 10:47.137
You've got everything
you need now?
你已经拥有了一切
你现在需要吗？

10:47.241 --> 10:49.344
Nobody's left,
we're completely alone?
一个人都没有留下
我们完全孤独吗？

10:49.448 --> 10:50.551
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

10:50.655 --> 10:52.137
In that case...
在这种情况下...

10:54.310 --> 10:55.896
Great parties, huh?
很棒的派对，是吧？

10:56.000 --> 10:57.000
Oh!
哦！

10:57.103 --> 10:58.793
Sorry, tubby, you got to go.
抱歉，胖子，你得走了。

10:58.896 --> 11:00.586
Wait, we can trust Patrick.
等等，我们可以相信帕特里克。

11:00.689 --> 11:01.965
He's my best friend.
他是我最好的朋友。

11:02.068 --> 11:03.724
Well, uh, I can't
take any chances.
嗯，呃，我不能
抓住一切机会。

11:03.827 --> 11:06.586
For all we know, uh,
he could be the Strangler.
据我们所知，呃，
他可能是绞杀者。

11:06.689 --> 11:08.206
I'm the Strangler?!
我就是绞杀者？！

11:08.310 --> 11:09.931
Oh, I should have known!
哦，我早该知道的！

11:10.034 --> 11:11.241
I got to turn myself in!
我得去自首！

11:14.965 --> 11:17.448
So Patrick's the Strangler.
所以帕特里克是绞杀者。

11:17.551 --> 11:19.310
Gee, you think you know a guy.
哎呀，你以为你认识一个人。

11:19.413 --> 11:21.068
He's not the Strangler!
他不是绞杀者！

11:21.172 --> 11:22.172
He's not?
他不是吗？

11:23.172 --> 11:25.275
I am!
我是！

11:25.379 --> 11:27.862
Hey, how'd you do that
without shaving cream?
嘿，你是怎么做到的
没有剃须膏？

11:27.965 --> 11:29.448
Oh, it's a fake, you idiot!
噢，这是假的，你这个白痴！

11:29.551 --> 11:31.137
I bought it at the party store!
我是在派对商店买的！

11:31.241 --> 11:33.068
Did someone say "party"?
有人说“聚会”吗？

11:36.275 --> 11:38.862
I can't take it!
我受不了！

11:38.965 --> 11:40.965
Wait, bodyguard,
I need protection!
等等，保镖，
我需要保护！

11:41.068 --> 11:42.206
Step on it!
踩它！

11:42.310 --> 11:43.793
I'm being chased by a maniac!
我正在被一个疯子追赶！

11:45.137 --> 11:46.413
I'm not safe!
我不安全！

11:46.517 --> 11:47.793
Come back!
回来！

11:52.551 --> 11:54.103
Finally! Away from that guy.
最后！远离那个人。

11:54.206 --> 11:55.758
Good idea, bodyguard.
好主意，保镖。

11:55.862 --> 11:57.172
He'll never find us up here.
他永远不会在这里找到我们。

12:03.206 --> 12:05.137
Good thinking, bodyguard.
好主意，保镖。

12:05.241 --> 12:07.655
The Strangler could have been
on that plane.
绞杀者可能是
在那架飞机上。

12:10.448 --> 12:12.068
Bodyguard!
Bodyguard!
保镖！
保镖！

12:12.172 --> 12:14.379
Look, kid...
瞧，孩子……

12:14.482 --> 12:17.068
I'm not your bodyguard!
我不是你的保镖！

12:18.758 --> 12:21.379
I'm the Strangler.
我是绞杀者。

12:21.482 --> 12:22.517
See?
看？

12:24.931 --> 12:26.344
The Strangler!
绞杀者！

12:26.448 --> 12:28.034
Good work, SpongeBob.
干得好，海绵宝宝。

12:28.137 --> 12:30.586
You put the Strangler
behind bars.
你把绞杀者
关在监狱里。

12:30.689 --> 12:33.758
At least I'm safe
from that yellow idiot.
至少我是安全的
来自那个黄色白痴。

12:33.862 --> 12:35.103
Hey, Mack.
嘿，马克。

12:35.206 --> 12:36.793
What are you in for?
你进来干什么？

12:49.137 --> 12:52.758
Well, Patrick, here it is,
the Palace of Pranks,
好吧，帕特里克，就是这里，
恶作剧宫殿，

12:52.862 --> 12:55.551
the greatest novelty shop
in Bikini Bottom.
最伟大的新奇店
在比基尼底部。

12:55.655 --> 12:58.103
All the greatest pranksters
shop here.
所有最伟大的恶作剧者
在这里购物。

12:58.206 --> 13:01.103
This is where I got
my gag seanut brittle can.
这就是我得到的地方
我的堵嘴花生脆罐头。

13:01.206 --> 13:02.965
Oh, boy, seanut brittle...
Give me!
哦，孩子，花生脆……
给我！

13:03.068 --> 13:05.275
Patrick, wait, it's
a booby trap, remember?
帕特里克，等等，这是
一个诱杀装置，还记得吗？

13:05.379 --> 13:08.586
Nice try, SquarePants, but it's
not going to work this time.
不错的尝试，SquarePants，但它是
这次不去上班了。

13:08.689 --> 13:11.758
I'm going to have some of
your delicious seanut brittle.
我要一些
你美味的花生脆。

13:13.000 --> 13:14.448
Where's the seanut brittle?
哪里有花生脆？

13:16.275 --> 13:18.896
That gets funnier every time
you say it, Patrick.
每次都变得更有趣
你说吧，帕特里克。

13:19.000 --> 13:20.344
Come on, let's go inside.
来吧，我们进去吧。

13:20.448 --> 13:22.310
Seanut brittle.
花生脆。

13:24.551 --> 13:26.275
Ah!
啊!

13:26.379 --> 13:29.448
Nothing compares to the smell
of cheap plastic novelty items.
没有什么能与气味相比
廉价的塑料新奇物品。

13:29.551 --> 13:33.275
Pranks, gags and gross-out toys
as far as the eye can see.
恶作剧、恶作剧和恶心的玩具
一眼望去。

13:33.379 --> 13:36.000
Isn't it everything I said
it would be, Patrick?
这不是我说的一切吗
会是这样吗，帕特里克？

13:36.103 --> 13:37.310
Hey, seanut brittle!
嘿，花生脆！

13:38.586 --> 13:39.724
Oh, darn it, not again.
哦，该死，不要再这样了。

13:42.000 --> 13:43.344
Good to see you, SpongeBob.
很高兴见到你，海绵宝宝。

13:43.448 --> 13:45.620
How's my number one
customer doing?
我的第一怎么样
客户在做什么？

13:45.724 --> 13:46.724
Great, Frank.
太棒了，弗兰克。

13:46.793 --> 13:48.068
This is my friend, Patrick.
这是我的朋友帕特里克。

13:48.172 --> 13:49.931
He wants to become
a prankster, too.
他想成为
也是个恶作剧者。

13:50.034 --> 13:51.862
Well, pleasure
to meet you, Patrick.
嗯，很高兴
见到你，帕特里克。

13:55.310 --> 13:57.448
That's your first lesson, son...
这是你的第一堂课，儿子……

13:57.551 --> 13:59.310
The granddaddy of all pranks,
所有恶作剧的祖父，

13:59.413 --> 14:00.482
the joy buzzer.
欢乐蜂鸣器。

14:00.586 --> 14:01.655
I don't get it.
我不明白。

14:01.758 --> 14:03.103
You don't have to get it.
你不必得到它。

14:03.206 --> 14:06.206
The prank is
for the enjoyment
of the prankster.
恶作剧是
为了享受
恶作剧者的。

14:06.310 --> 14:08.931
You see, Patrick,
Frank here is the master.
你看，帕特里克，
弗兰克是这里的主人。

14:09.034 --> 14:11.655
I learned all I know
about pranks from him.
我学会了我所知道的一切
关于他的恶作剧。

14:11.758 --> 14:13.206
Frank, let's see
what you've got.
弗兰克，让我们看看
你有什么。

14:13.310 --> 14:15.379
Well, this came in
just this morning.
嗯，这个进来了
就在今天早上。

14:15.482 --> 14:16.965
Have some gum.
吃点口香糖吧

14:20.068 --> 14:23.000
Ha! Exploding chewing gum,
only $9.95.
哈!口香糖爆炸，
只需 9.95 美元。

14:23.103 --> 14:24.275
I don't get it.
我不明白。

14:24.379 --> 14:26.172
What can we get for one dollar?
一美元我们能得到什么？

14:26.275 --> 14:28.551
One dollar will get you
this fake gag dollar...
一美元就能给你
这个假的恶作剧美元...

14:28.655 --> 14:31.655
Fool your friends into thinking
you've got a real dollar.
欺骗你的朋友思考
你有一块真正的美元。

14:31.758 --> 14:32.965
What else have you got?
你还有什么？

14:33.068 --> 14:34.137
A whoopee cushion?
欢呼垫？

14:34.241 --> 14:34.793
Nah.
不。

14:34.896 --> 14:36.103
Fake vomit.
假呕吐。

14:36.206 --> 14:36.827
No.
不。

14:36.931 --> 14:38.137
Real vomit.
真想吐。

14:38.241 --> 14:38.931
Eww!
哇！

14:39.034 --> 14:40.310
Have anything good?
有什么好东西吗？

14:40.413 --> 14:43.448
Well, there is one prank
that I've been saving
嗯，有一个恶作剧
我一直在保存的

14:43.551 --> 14:46.413
for a real top-of-the-line
prankster...
真正的顶级
恶作剧者...

14:46.517 --> 14:48.655
Invisible spray.
隐形喷雾。

14:48.758 --> 14:51.827
Wow, invisible spray!
哇，隐形喷雾！

14:51.931 --> 14:53.241
But I can see it.
但我能看到它。

14:53.344 --> 14:55.551
Gee, Patrick, just
think of the pranks
哎呀，帕特里克，只是
想想恶作剧

14:55.655 --> 14:56.827
we could pull with this.
我们可以这样做。

14:58.379 --> 14:59.379
Good choice.
不错的选择。

14:59.413 --> 15:01.379
Now, be careful
with that stuff, boys.
现在，要小心
孩子们，用那些东西。

15:01.482 --> 15:02.344
It stains clothes.
它会弄脏衣服。

15:02.448 --> 15:03.689
Thanks, Frank.
谢谢，弗兰克。

15:03.793 --> 15:06.034
Here it is, Patrick,
在这里，帕特里克，

15:06.137 --> 15:07.344
the ultimate prank...
最终的恶作剧...

15:07.448 --> 15:08.310
Invisible spray.
隐形喷雾。

15:08.413 --> 15:10.413
What are we going to do with it?
我们要用它做什么？

15:10.517 --> 15:11.724
I know!
我知道！

15:11.827 --> 15:13.413
We'll go spray the park bench
我们去公园长椅上喷洒

15:13.517 --> 15:14.655
and then sit on it,
然后坐在上面，

15:14.758 --> 15:16.172
and when people walk by,
当人们走过时，

15:16.275 --> 15:18.241
we'll be floating in midair.
我们将漂浮在半空中。

15:19.206 --> 15:20.586
They're floating in midair!
他们漂浮在半空中！

15:20.689 --> 15:22.068
How do they do that?
他们是怎么做到的？

15:22.896 --> 15:24.724
That's the ultimate prank!
这就是终极恶作剧！

15:24.827 --> 15:26.241
Good idea, SpongeBob!
好主意，海绵宝宝！

15:26.344 --> 15:27.689
Well, let's get started.
好吧，让我们开始吧。

15:28.724 --> 15:30.000
Okay, I'm ready.
好的，我准备好了。

15:30.103 --> 15:33.206
Any particular reason
you took your pants off?
任何特定原因
你把裤子脱了吗？

15:33.310 --> 15:35.482
Well, that stuff
stains clothes, right?
嗯，那个东西
衣服上有污渍，对吗？

15:35.586 --> 15:38.000
That it does, Patrick,
that it does.
确实如此，帕特里克，
确实如此。

15:38.103 --> 15:39.103
Good thinking.
好想法。

15:39.137 --> 15:41.310
Here, hold this a second.
在这里，等一下。

15:41.413 --> 15:43.241
Okay, Patrick, give me the can.
好吧，帕特里克，把罐子给我。

15:43.344 --> 15:46.172
I think since spraying
the park bench was my idea,
我想自从喷了之后
公园长椅是我的主意

15:46.275 --> 15:47.827
I should get to spray it.
我应该去喷它。

15:47.931 --> 15:49.482
Patrick, spraying the park bench
帕特里克在公园长椅上喷洒

15:49.586 --> 15:50.758
was myidea.
是我的主意。

15:50.862 --> 15:52.758
Yeah, but I said
it was a good idea.
是的，但我说过
这是个好主意。

15:52.862 --> 15:53.862
Give me that thing.
把那个东西给我。

15:59.413 --> 16:01.310
Hey, the invisible spray works!
嘿，隐形喷雾起作用了！

16:01.413 --> 16:03.413
And on your right if you look,
如果你看的话，在你的右边，

16:03.517 --> 16:06.586
you'll see two
naked guys fighting
over a can of paint.
你会看到两个
裸体男人打架
超过一罐油漆。

16:09.793 --> 16:11.655
Oh, my gosh, Patrick,
help me find our clothes!
哦，天哪，帕特里克，
帮我找到我们的衣服！

16:16.034 --> 16:17.931
I got to handit
to you, SpongeBob.
我必须交出
给你，海绵宝宝。

16:18.034 --> 16:19.068
You look kind of funny.
你看起来有点滑稽。

16:21.241 --> 16:22.482
Righty, where are you?
右，你在哪里？

16:23.724 --> 16:25.241
No one messes with Righty!
没人敢惹Righty！

16:25.344 --> 16:26.655
We'll see how youlike it.
我们会看看你是否喜欢它。

16:29.172 --> 16:31.413
Kind of gives you
an emptyfeeling, huh?
有点给你
一种空虚的感觉吧？

16:32.482 --> 16:33.482
Yeah!
是的！

16:34.344 --> 16:35.620
I seewhat you mean.
我明白你的意思了。

16:39.068 --> 16:40.103
No guts, no glory!
没有勇气，就没有荣耀！

16:45.931 --> 16:47.448
I think this thing is empty.
我觉得这个东西是空的。

16:47.551 --> 16:49.310
Oh, no, it can't be!
噢，不，不可能！

16:49.413 --> 16:51.689
How are we going to pull
off the ultimate prank?
我们要如何拉
结束了终极恶作剧？

16:51.793 --> 16:52.931
Thanks a lot, Patrick.
非常感谢，帕特里克。

16:53.034 --> 16:54.068
You used the last of it.
你用了最后一个。

16:55.862 --> 16:57.275
Hey, I think I found our pants.
嘿，我想我找到了我们的裤子。

16:58.344 --> 17:00.241
Oops!
Here, these are yours.
哎呀！
在这里，这些是你的。

17:00.344 --> 17:01.896
Oh, forget the pants, Patrick.
哦，忘了裤子吧，帕特里克。

17:02.000 --> 17:04.000
Let's get home and
wash this paint off.
我们回家吧
把这油漆洗掉。

17:04.103 --> 17:06.310
Hey, SpongeBob, do you
know what time it is?
嘿，海绵宝宝，你呢
知道现在几点了吗？

17:06.413 --> 17:09.620
Oh, sure, it's...
half past invisible.
哦，当然，这是...
半点看不见。

17:09.724 --> 17:11.034
Gee, it's getting late.
哎呀，已经晚了。

17:11.137 --> 17:12.482
Let's ask this guy.
我们去问问这个人吧。

17:12.586 --> 17:14.758
Sir, but do you have the time?
先生，但是您有时间吗？

17:14.862 --> 17:16.000
Sure, it's ten
to 3:00.
当然可以，十点了
至 3:00。

17:16.103 --> 17:17.103
Thank you.
谢谢。

17:17.137 --> 17:18.034
Don't mention it.
别提了。

17:18.137 --> 17:19.448
Don't mention what?
不提什么？

17:19.551 --> 17:20.551
Who said that?
谁说的？

17:20.620 --> 17:21.620
Me.
我。

17:22.620 --> 17:23.758
Ghosts!
鬼魂！

17:26.413 --> 17:28.034
Hey, I'm no ghost!
嘿嘿，我不是鬼！

17:28.137 --> 17:30.965
The nerve of that guy
and his driving eyeballs.
那家伙的神经
和他那锐利的眼球。

17:31.068 --> 17:33.034
Wait a second, Patrick,
等一下，帕特里克，

17:33.137 --> 17:34.827
my brain just hatched an idea.
我的大脑刚刚萌生了一个想法。

17:34.931 --> 17:35.931
Lay it on me.
放在我身上。

17:36.034 --> 17:37.827
Okay, we're invisible, right?
好吧，我们是隐形的，对吧？

17:37.931 --> 17:39.206
Yeah.
是的。

17:39.310 --> 17:41.379
If that guy thought
we were ghosts,
如果那家伙以为
我们曾是幽灵，

17:41.482 --> 17:43.758
we could haunt everybody
in Bikini Bottom.
我们可以困扰每个人
在比基尼底部。

17:43.862 --> 17:45.344
Oh, it's the ultimate prank.
哦，这真是终极恶作剧。

17:45.448 --> 17:46.551
High five!
高五！

17:47.586 --> 17:50.551
Let's go scare us some suckers.
我们去吓吓我们这些傻瓜吧。

17:55.655 --> 17:56.689
Huh?
啊？

17:59.620 --> 18:01.586
That's funny,
I thought I heard voices.
这很有趣，
我以为我听到了声音。

18:01.689 --> 18:03.068
Huh?
啊？

18:03.172 --> 18:06.137
I thought I left that glass
of peanut juice on the table.
我以为我留下了那个玻璃杯
桌上的花生汁。

18:06.241 --> 18:08.793
And didn't I toss
that old lamp out yesterday?
而且我没有折腾吗
昨天那个旧灯灭了吗？

18:08.896 --> 18:12.896
And since when did I acquire
all these portraits of Patrick?
从什么时候开始我获得了
所有这些帕特里克的肖像？

18:16.034 --> 18:18.172
We're ghosts.
我们是鬼魂。

18:22.068 --> 18:23.655
I knew it was you guys!
我就知道是你们！

18:23.758 --> 18:25.344
All right, joke's over.
好了，笑话结束了。

18:25.448 --> 18:27.206
Take off the sheets.
取下床单。

18:28.344 --> 18:29.344
It isghosts!
是鬼！

18:41.448 --> 18:43.620
Boy, we really scared her!
男孩，我们真的吓到她了！

18:44.862 --> 18:48.000
Who's going to be
our next victim?
谁会成为
我们的下一个受害者？

18:48.103 --> 18:51.310
A better question
would be, "Who isn't?"
一个更好的问题
会是，“谁不是？”

18:52.827 --> 18:55.206
Double-dark deep-sea
light diet cake!
双暗深海
轻食减肥蛋糕！

18:56.482 --> 18:58.275
You will soon be mine.
你很快就会成为我的。

19:05.344 --> 19:08.793
Ghosts!
鬼魂！

19:15.655 --> 19:17.310
Huh?
啊？

19:20.206 --> 19:22.310
Ghosts!
鬼魂！

19:23.724 --> 19:26.689
PATRICK AND SPONGEBOB Cowabunga!
帕特里克和海绵宝宝 Cowabunga！

19:26.793 --> 19:27.793
Ghosts!
鬼魂！

19:29.000 --> 19:30.068
Ghosts!
鬼魂！

19:30.172 --> 19:31.551
Ghosts!
鬼魂！

19:31.655 --> 19:32.689
Ghosts!
鬼魂！

19:32.793 --> 19:33.655
Ghosts!
鬼魂！

19:33.758 --> 19:34.793
Toast.
吐司。

19:34.896 --> 19:36.758
Ghosts!
鬼魂！

19:38.413 --> 19:41.068
It's official... we're the
greatest pranksters ever.
这是官方的...我们是
有史以来最伟大的恶作剧者。

19:41.172 --> 19:42.862
The whole town
thinks we're ghosts.
整个城镇
认为我们是鬼魂。

19:42.965 --> 19:44.517
Yeah.
是的。

19:44.620 --> 19:46.827
There's only one guy
left to scare,
只有一个人
留下来吓唬，

19:46.931 --> 19:49.689
and we'll have pranked everybody
in Bikini Bottom...
我们会恶作剧所有人
在比基尼底部...

19:49.793 --> 19:51.758
Mr. Krabs.
蟹老板。

19:51.862 --> 19:54.448
It says he isn't
scared of ghosts.
据说他不是
害怕鬼。

19:54.551 --> 19:57.344
We'll see about that!
我们拭目以待吧！

19:59.758 --> 20:00.758
Ghosts!
鬼魂！

20:00.827 --> 20:01.827
Hah!
哈！

20:01.931 --> 20:04.000
I ain't afraid of no ghosts!
我什么鬼都不怕！

20:04.103 --> 20:07.448
Every sailor knows a ghost
won't come near a fella
每个水手都认识一个鬼魂
不会靠近一个人

20:07.551 --> 20:10.620
as long as he's wearing
his spotted neckerchief...
只要他穿着
他的斑点领巾……

20:10.724 --> 20:13.103
and his dried-up sea leprechaun.
还有他干涸的海妖精。

20:13.206 --> 20:15.137
And a bit of gold never hurt.
一点金子永远不会有坏处。

20:15.241 --> 20:16.827
But to be on the safe side,
但为了安全起见，

20:16.931 --> 20:19.965
I'm also wearing me pants
in a melvin knot,
我也穿我的裤子
在梅尔文结中，

20:20.068 --> 20:21.965
got me shivering timber brace,
让我颤抖的木支架，

20:22.068 --> 20:26.413
and the hairs on the back
of me neck are taped down.
和后面的毛发
我的脖子被胶带粘住了。

20:26.517 --> 20:30.482
And I'm all wrapped up
in a suit of anti-ghost armor.
我全身心投入
身穿反鬼铠甲。

20:30.586 --> 20:35.034
And if none of this stuff works,
I've got me secret weapon...
如果这些东西都不起作用
我有秘密武器...

20:35.137 --> 20:36.620
The specter deflector.
幽灵偏转器。

20:36.724 --> 20:39.689
So just try and get me,
you ghosts!
所以试着让我，
你们这些鬼魂！

20:39.793 --> 20:41.413
Bring it on!
来吧！

20:43.655 --> 20:46.068
Krabs.
螃蟹。

20:46.172 --> 20:49.896
Krabs, we've come to haunt you.
蟹蟹们，我们是来骚扰你们的。

20:50.000 --> 20:51.965
Stay back, I'm well-armed!
退后一步，我全副武装！

20:55.586 --> 20:57.862
I'm warning you.
我警告你。

21:01.896 --> 21:04.241
Ooh!
哦！

21:04.344 --> 21:05.758
Boo.
嘘。

21:07.620 --> 21:10.689
I got to get out of here!
我必须离开这里！

21:10.793 --> 21:14.379
You can't escape, Krabs.
你逃不掉的，蟹蟹。

21:14.482 --> 21:16.517
We glued the door shut.
我们把门粘上了。

21:16.620 --> 21:18.413
You'll never get me!
你永远得不到我！

21:20.310 --> 21:26.172
Nice try, Krabs, but we replaced
all the glass with rubber.
不错的尝试，螃蟹，但我们更换了
所有玻璃都带有橡胶。

21:29.448 --> 21:34.379
Too late, Krabs, we've already
clogged all the toilets.
太晚了，蟹蟹，我们已经
堵塞了所有的厕所。

21:34.482 --> 21:37.517
Please, spirits, leave me be.
拜托，精灵们，让我安静吧。

21:37.931 --> 21:40.793
We got him good, SpongeBob.
我们把他搞定了，海绵宝宝。

21:40.896 --> 21:43.896
Wait, Patrick,
I've got one more idea.
等等，帕特里克，
我还有一个想法。

21:44.000 --> 21:46.862
You're going to pay, Krabs.
你要付钱的，蟹蟹。

21:46.965 --> 21:48.517
No, spirits, please!
不，请精神！

21:50.000 --> 21:51.000
No!
不！

21:52.896 --> 21:54.379
No!
不！

21:54.482 --> 21:56.793
Don't burn me dollar!
别烧我美元！

22:01.896 --> 22:06.068
Well, well, well, if it isn't
SpongeBob and Patrick.
好吧好吧，如果不是的话
海绵宝宝和帕特里克。

22:07.275 --> 22:09.517
I know not these names
我不知道这些名字

22:09.620 --> 22:10.896
of which you speak.
你所说的。

22:11.000 --> 22:12.586
Uh, SpongeBob.
呃，海绵宝宝。

22:12.689 --> 22:16.000
SpongeBob, we're visible again.
海绵宝宝，我们又出现了。

22:17.758 --> 22:21.689
So you two are
the Bikini Bottom ghosts.
所以你们两个是
比基尼泳裤鬼魂。

22:21.793 --> 22:23.103
We're really sorry,
Mr. Krabs.
我们真的很抱歉，
蟹老板。

22:23.206 --> 22:26.206
Please don't chop us
up into little pieces
and eat them.
请不要砍我们
分成小块
并吃掉它们。

22:26.310 --> 22:27.965
Hey, come on, boys, I'm hip.
嘿，来吧，孩子们，我很时髦。

22:28.068 --> 22:31.413
I pulled my share of pranks
when I was your age,
我做了我的恶作剧
当我在你这个年纪的时候

22:31.517 --> 22:32.655
had me some laughs.
让我笑了。

22:32.758 --> 22:34.862
That's what we did tonight,
right?
这就是我们今晚所做的
对吗？

22:34.965 --> 22:36.206
We had a good laugh.
我们笑得很开心。

22:36.310 --> 22:37.758
Come on, laugh with me.
来吧，和我一起笑吧。

22:46.517 --> 22:50.793
Uh, any particular reason
you boys are naked?
呃，有什么特殊原因吗
你们男孩是裸体的吗？

22:50.896 --> 22:53.000
Yeah, the invisible
paint stains clothes.
是的，看不见的
油漆弄脏衣服。

22:54.206 --> 22:55.793
Of course it does.
当然可以。

22:55.896 --> 22:58.793
Well, you two better hurry home
before someone sees you nude.
好吧，你们两个还是赶紧回家吧
在有人看到你的裸体之前。

22:58.896 --> 23:01.965
Yeah, I think I'd
die of embarrassment
if that happened.
是的，我想我会
尴尬而死
如果发生这种情况。

23:02.068 --> 23:03.172
Me, too.
我也是。

23:03.275 --> 23:04.620
No, wouldn't want that,
would we?
不，不想这样，
我们会吗？

23:04.724 --> 23:05.758
It's getting late now.
现在已经很晚了。

23:05.862 --> 23:07.655
You pranksters better get going.
你们这些恶作剧者最好赶紧行动起来。

23:07.758 --> 23:10.620
Mr. Krabs, thanks for
being such a good sport.
蟹老板，谢谢你
这是一项如此好的运动。

23:10.724 --> 23:11.758
Don't mention it.
别提了。

23:11.862 --> 23:14.896
That Mr. Krabs, always
looking out for me.
那个蟹老板，总是
照顾我。

23:15.000 --> 23:15.896
What a guy!
真是个家伙啊！

23:16.000 --> 23:16.896
Yeah.
是的。

23:17.000 --> 23:19.241
The Krusty Krab presents...
蟹堡王呈现...

23:19.344 --> 23:22.482
live nude pranksters!
现场裸体恶作剧者！

23:22.586 --> 23:25.862
Starring the Bikini Bottom
ghosts.
主演比基尼泳裤
鬼魂。

23:37.068 --> 23:38.068
Patrick!
帕特里克！

23:38.172 --> 23:39.655
Yeah?
是的？

23:39.758 --> 23:42.827
We should have bought
the whoopee cushion.
我们应该买
欢呼垫。

